      "summary": "Blast radius: tier high (single-task Lane authority relay: kernel_ports.ts authorize, new lane_decision.ts, batch_state.ts identity rebind, lane_supervisor.ts exit accounting, dist bundle). The diff meets DAL-S5-A1 and A2. The Parent Host's own gate answers the decision and a stale revision is refused before the gate. A cancelled gate applies nothing and starts no generation. The breaking-revision rebind uses only the Kernel-committed revision. Initiative children are never matched by findLaneRelayTarget. QA outcomes passed for both acceptances.",
